flowchart LR
  APP[App/PWA] --> GW[API Gateway]
  TOTEM[Totem] --> GW
  STAFF[Recepção/Staff] --> GW
  AMB[Ambulância] --> GW
  DEV[Medical Devices/Gateways] --> TEL[Telemetry Service]

  GW --> PR[Patient Registry]
  GW --> PJ[Patient Journey]
  GW --> TRI[Triage]
  GW --> Q[Queue]
  GW --> PRES[Presence]
  GW --> PRE[Pre-Hospital]

  PR --> PJ
  PRE --> PR
  PRE --> TEL
  TEL --> K[(Kafka)]
  K --> TRI
  TRI --> K
  K --> Q
  PRES --> K
  K --> NOTIF[Notification]
  K --> PROJ[Projection Workers]
  PROJ --> REDIS[(Redis)]
  PROJ --> READ[(PostgreSQL Read Models)]

  NOTIF --> PUSH[Push/SMS]
  NOTIF --> DISPLAY[Telão/Chamada verbal]

  READ --> CLINICAL[ClinicalPatientView]
  REDIS --> PATVIEW[PatientCurrentVisitView]
